#lang scribble/manual

@(require "../support/documentation-navigation.rkt"
          "../support/paragraph-feedback.rkt")

@title[#:tag "skia-guide" #:style (skia-feedback-style)]{The Skia Guide}
@(documentation-navigation-band 'guide #:index? #t)
@author[(author+email "Jens Axel Søgaard" "jensaxel@soegaard.net")]

The Guide to Skia for Racket is planned. The audience of the Skia Guide will
be programmers new to Skia.

It will assume some experience in Racket. The idea is to present how to use
Skia in a less-detailed way than the Skia Reference.

I would like to know what you would like to see in the Skia Guide. Please
suggest topics and examples. Use the form below to submit an idea.

@(guide-feedback-form)
